# trunk

--- Domain_abi | attack | TID_DOMAIN_WEAPON_DESC
raw  Trunk spins in a circle after a short delay, dealing damage to enemies and dropping ants. Standing near ants gives Trunk a <VALUE1>% movement speed boost and <VALUE2>% damage boost. The edge of the attack deals more damage to enemies.
now  Trunk spins in a circle after a short delay, dealing damage to enemies and dropping ants. Standing near ants gives Trunk a <VALUE1>% movement speed boost and <VALUE2>% damage boost. The edge of the attack deals more damage to enemies.
  VALUE1  -  -> 30
  VALUE2  -  -> 30

--- Domain_gadget_2 | gadget | TID_DOMAIN_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Trunk heals from the first source of damage taken for the next <VALUE1> secs.
now  Trunk heals from the first source of damage taken for the next <VALUE1> secs.
  VALUE1  -  -> 2

--- Domain_unique_1 | star power | TID_DOMAIN_SP_1_DESC
